From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: samuelmaddock <samuel.maddock@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2020 15:00:26 -0400
Subject: win: exclude windows with black rects

Adds a DesktopCapturer wrapper for Windows to exclude the chat head window by
painting a black rectangle above it. This is interoperable with any underlying
desktop capture API.

Signed-off-by: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>

